#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A brief introduction to the course structure, intended audience, and to the "
"variational quantum eigensolver."
msgstr ""
"Pengenalan ringkas kepada struktur kursus, khalayak sasaran, dan variational"
" quantum eigensolver."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Pengenalan"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Lipinska allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen "
"mozallowfullscreen oallowfullscreen msallowfullscreen referrerpolicy Fedorov"
" */}\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Lipinska allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen "
"mozallowfullscreen oallowfullscreen msallowfullscreen referrerpolicy Fedorov"
" */}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is a focused introduction to the variational quantum eigensolver"
" (VQE), including the application of VQE to chemistry. The course is "
"intended for technical practitioners of quantum computing who are interested"
" in applying quantum computing to chemical, biochemical, or biophysical "
"problems. This course covers important elements of a VQE calculation, "
"including these:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini ialah pengenalan tertumpu kepada variational quantum eigensolver "
"(VQE), termasuk aplikasi VQE dalam kimia. Kursus ini ditujukan untuk "
"pengamal teknikal pengkomputeran kuantum yang berminat untuk mengaplikasikan"
" pengkomputeran kuantum kepada masalah kimia, biokimia, atau biofizik. "
"Kursus ini merangkumi elemen penting pengiraan VQE, termasuk yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Hamiltonian\n"
msgstr "Hamiltonian\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Ansatz\n"
msgstr "Ansatz\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Classical optimizer\n"
msgstr "Pengoptimum klasik\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All these elements are brought together to build VQE calculations on Qiskit "
"Runtime Primitives, primarily Estimator. For information about primitives "
"see the [documentation](/guides/primitives). In setting up a VQE "
"calculation, we will follow the standard Qiskit patterns framework:\n"
msgstr ""
"Semua elemen ini digabungkan untuk membina pengiraan VQE pada Qiskit Runtime"
" Primitives, terutamanya Estimator. Untuk maklumat tentang primitif, lihat "
"[dokumentasi](/guides/primitives). Dalam menetapkan pengiraan VQE, kita akan"
" mengikuti rangka kerja corak Qiskit standard:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Map classical inputs to a quantum problem\n"
msgstr "Petakan input klasik kepada masalah kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Optimize problem for quantum execution\n"
msgstr "Optimumkan masalah untuk pelaksanaan kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Execute using Qiskit Runtime primitives\n"
msgstr "Laksanakan menggunakan primitif Qiskit Runtime\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Post-process, return result in classical format\n"
msgstr "Proses pasca, kembalikan hasil dalam format klasik\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some explanation of the framework will be found throughout this course, but "
"for a complete explanation with examples of Qiskit patterns, see [this "
"documentation](/guides/intro-to-patterns).\n"
msgstr ""
"Beberapa penjelasan tentang rangka kerja akan ditemui sepanjang kursus ini, "
"tetapi untuk penjelasan lengkap dengan contoh corak Qiskit, lihat "
"[dokumentasi ini](/guides/intro-to-patterns).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We recommend planning to devote approximately 6-10 hours to the completion "
"of this course. The videos and reading are likely to take two hours to "
"complete. The remaining time is for executing and modifying code cells, "
"completing quiz questions, and reading linked documentation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami mengesyorkan merancang untuk meluangkan kira-kira 6-10 jam untuk "
"menyelesaikan kursus ini. Video dan bacaan kemungkinan memerlukan masa dua "
"jam untuk diselesaikan. Masa yang tinggal adalah untuk melaksanakan dan "
"mengubah suai sel kod, melengkapkan soalan kuiz, dan membaca dokumentasi "
"yang dipautkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum&reg; has other upskilling offerings related to VQE. If you are "
"already familiar with the components of VQE and simply wish to put it into "
"practice, see our tutorial: [Ground-state energy estimation of the "
"Heisenberg chain with VQE](/tutorials/spin-chain-vqe).\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Quantum&reg; mempunyai tawaran peningkatan kemahiran lain yang berkaitan"
" dengan VQE. Jika anda sudah biasa dengan komponen VQE dan hanya ingin "
"mengamalkannya, lihat tutorial kami: [Anggaran tenaga keadaan dasar rantai "
"Heisenberg dengan VQE](/tutorials/spin-chain-vqe).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of VQE {#overview-of-vqe}"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan VQE {#overview-of-vqe}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's begin our study of VQE by watching this overview video, presented by "
"the IBM Quantum Americas Lead for Quantum Innovation Centers, Dr. Victoria "
"Lipinska.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mari kita mulakan kajian VQE dengan menonton video gambaran keseluruhan ini,"
" yang dipersembahkan oleh Ketua Amerika IBM Quantum untuk Pusat Inovasi "
"Kuantum, Dr. Victoria Lipinska.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You will learn what VQE is, what it can do, and why it is likely to be "
"useful in the near-term over other quantum computing algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda akan belajar apa itu VQE, apa yang boleh dilakukannya, dan mengapa ia "
"berkemungkinan berguna dalam jangka masa terdekat berbanding algoritma "
"pengkomputeran kuantum yang lain.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<IBMVideo id=\"132414895\" title=\"Victoria Lipinska gives an overview of "
"VQE, what it can do, and why it is likely to be useful in the near-"
"term.\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"<IBMVideo id=\"132414895\" title=\"Victoria Lipinska memberi gambaran "
"keseluruhan VQE, apa yang boleh dilakukannya, dan mengapa ia berkemungkinan "
"berguna dalam jangka masa terdekat.\"/>\n"

